{
  "version": "Notebook/1.0",
  "items": [
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "## Origination Workbench — Operations\n\nOne place for the things App Insights and the app do not show on their own: what is deployed where, whether the scheduled jobs and Logic Apps ran, which alerts are open, and how the integrations are behaving. \nStandard telemetry (failures, performance, live metrics, logs) and adoption numbers (the in-app Usage Dashboard) are **linked**, not copied."
      },
      "name": "text - 1"
    },
    {
      "type": 9,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
        "crossComponentResources": [
          "value::all"
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "Subscriptions",
            "label": "Subscriptions",
            "type": 6,
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "quote": "'",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "typeSettings": {
