    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "Deployments come from the GitHub Actions deploy workflows ([Dev](https://scoular.ghe.com/IT/origination/actions/workflows/deploy-dev.yml) · [QA](https://scoular.ghe.com/IT/origination/actions/workflows/deploy-qa.yml) · [PROD](https://scoular.ghe.com/IT/origination/actions/workflows/deploy-prod.yml)). The commit and build number running right now are shown in the app under the profile menu, which reads `/api/version`."
      },
